ms (one per room) with shower<br />✔ 1 social half-bath on ground floor (sink + toilet)<br />✔ 1 outdoor bathroom near the pool (sink + toilet)<br /><br />All full bathrooms feature:<br />✔ Tempered glass shower with wood details<br />✔ LED lighting<br />✔ Hot water available at all times<br />✔ Large mirrors<br />✔ Hand soap, body soap & toilet paper (welcome supply)<br /><br />Important note: We provide bathroom supplies as an initial welcome set. Once they run out, guests are responsible for restocking, as we operate as a vacation rental, not a hotel.<br /><br />\uD83C\uDF34 OUTDOORS & COMMON AREAS \uD83C\uDF34<br />Entrance:<br />✔ Buddha water fountain sculpture — a sense of peace and harmony from the very first step<br />✔ 2 balconies with lake views (master bedroom & 2nd-floor TV room)<br /><br />Pool area:<br />✔ Large conventional pool with direct views of Lake Calima<br />✔ Natural river-fed pool with waterfall — natural water, no chlorine (unique in the area)<br />✔ Jacuzzi<br />✔ Pergola<br />✔ Sun loungers<br />✔ Outdoor shower<br />✔ Outdoor bathroom near the pool<br /><br />BBQ & bonfire area:<br />✔ BBQ pavilion with grill & utensils<br />✔ Bonfire area with comfortable seating<br />✔ Panoramic views of the lake and mountains<br /><br />Covered outdoor platform:<br />✔ Outdoor kitchen with mini fridge<br />✔ Outdoor grill<br />✔ Outdoor table & chairs<br />✔ Covered structure — usable any time of day<br /><br />Coworking:<br />✔ Dedicated coworking area with 200 Mbps Wi-Fi<br /><br />Parking:<br />✔ Private parking for 17 vehicles at no extra charge<br /><br />⚠ IMPORTANT BEFORE YOU BOOK ⚠<br />✔ 2-story villa with internal stairs — not suitable for guests with severe mobility limitations<br />✔ No washing machine available on the property<br />✔ No breakfast service included<br />✔ No crib or high chair available<br />✔ Completely quiet area — no street noise, traffic or nearby bars<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />\uD83C\uDFE1 THE ENTIRE PROPERTY IS EXCLUSIVELY YOURS \uD83C\uDFE1<br />When you book, you get full private access to:<br />✔ All 5 bedrooms with private en-suite bathrooms<br />✔ Main living room & dining area<br />✔ Fully equipped kitchen<br />✔ 2 pools + jacuzzi + outdoor shower<br />✔ BBQ zone, bonfire area & outdoor platform<br />✔ Indoor social bathroom & outdoor pool bathroom<br />✔ All balconies & outdoor spaces<br />✔ Coworking area<br />✔ Private parking for 17 vehicles<br /><br />⛔ RESTRICTED AREA ⛔<br />The estate's hangar is off-limits to guests.<br />It is where tools and equipment exclusive to authorized estate staff are stored.<br /><br />\uD83D\uDC64 CHECK-IN METHOD \uD83D\uDC64<br />In-person check-in with personal handover.<br />✔ The caretaker lives on the property and is available 24/7<br />✔ Upon arrival, the caretaker will welcome you and walk you through the entire property<br />✔ Exact arrival directions and meeting point will be sent on your booking day via the Airbnb app<br />✔ Late arrivals are never a problem — the caretaker will be there regardless of the hour<br /><br />ℹ ACCESSIBILITY ℹ<br />✔ Suitable for children of all ages (permanent pool supervision is mandatory)<br />✔ Suitable for older adults on the ground floor<br />✔ Not suitable for guests with severe mobility limitations (2-story villa, internal stairs only)<br />✔ No crib or high chair available<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />1. \uD83D\uDCCB GUEST REGISTRATION \uD83D\uDCCB<br />It is mandatory to register the exact number of guests when booking.<br />Upon arrival, guest count will be verified against the reservation.<br />Maximum capacity: 26 guests.<br /><br />2. \uD83D\uDD50 CHECK-IN & CHECK-OUT TIMES \uD83D\uDD50<br />✔ Check-in: from 3:00 PM<br />✔ Check-out: before 11:00 AM<br />✔ Early check-in: check availability via app before arrival<br />✔ Late check-out: request via app in advance<br /><br />3. \uD83D\uDC3E PETS \uD83D\uDC3E<br />✔ Pets are welcome<br />✔ Mandatory conditions:<b